  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "持たせたポケモンは　１度だけ相手の　能力が　あがったときまねして　同じように　能力を　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "지니게 한 포켓몬은 한 번에 한해 상대의 능력이 올랐을 때 흉내 내어 똑같이 능력을 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "攜帶它的寶可夢將有１次機會，在對手的能力提高時自己也跟著提高能力。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Lorsqu’un adversaire bénéficie d’une augmentation de stats, permet une fois seulement au porteur d’en bénéficier également.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Item zum Tragen. Es ermöglicht dem Träger einmalig, die Statuswerterhöhungen eines Gegners zu kopieren.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el rival aumenta sus características, permite al Pokémon que la lleva imitarlo y aumentar las suyas también, pero solo una vez.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento monouso da dare a un Pokémon. Permette di fare propri gli aumenti di statistiche di un Pokémon avversario.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This herb will allow the holder to mirror an opponent’s stat increases to boost its own stats—but only once.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせたポケモンは　１度だけ相手の　能力が　あがったときまねして　同じように　能力を　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带它的宝可梦仅有１次机会可以在对手提高能力时，对其进行模仿并提高同样的能力。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el rival aumenta sus características, permite al Pokémon que la lleva imitarlo y aumentar las suyas también, pero solo una vez.",
